[PrintTextModified Text:ユキちゃんは……仲間のことを想って……。|#0206Trial07_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,Arms,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Cry_Closed01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:けれど……それは【呪い】だ。|#0206Trial07_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:死者に囚われていては、前に進めない……。|#0206Trial07_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:……都合よく死者の言葉でも<br>聞こえる人がいればいいのだけれど。|#0206Trial07_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Disappointed_Open,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:んなことできるやつがいたら<br>もう誰かやってんだろ。|#0206Trial07_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:うーん、他に誰か知らないかな～？<br>ユキちゃんを止められる方法……。|#0206Trial07_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmL5,ArmR4,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:（……ボクたちが【知らない情報を知っている人物】……？）|#0206Trial07_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Determined_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:"（記憶を共有した今、<br>　それは【ボクたちも知らない人】じゃないと<br>　ありえないのかもしれない……）|#0206Trial07_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

